### Get UTC day of week from Date object

Source: https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/javascript/reference/global_objects/date/getutcday/index.md

Demonstrates how to use getUTCDay() to retrieve the day of the week in UTC time. The method returns an integer where 0 is Sunday through 6 is Saturday. Works with Date objects created with various timezone specifications.

```javascript
const date1 = new Date("August 19, 1975 23:15:30 GMT+11:00");
const date2 = new Date("August 19, 1975 23:15:30 GMT-11:00");

// Tuesday
console.log(date1.getUTCDay());
// Expected output: 2

// Wednesday
console.log(date2.getUTCDay());
// Expected output: 3
```

