### Create UTC Date Object with Date.UTC() in JavaScript

Source: https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/javascript/reference/global_objects/date/utc/index.md

Example of creating a Date object using Date.UTC() with specific UTC date and time values. This creates a Date object representing December 1, 2018 at 00:00:00 UTC.

```javascript
const utcDate = new Date(Date.UTC(2018, 11, 1, 0, 0, 0));
```